From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:13:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: spi: samsung: Describe Tensor G4

Add the Tensor G4 SPI integration compatible with the gs101 fallback.
The fallback lets older kernels bind, but their automatic native CS
still prevents the Pixel 9a touchscreen from working. The specific
match selects message-level manual native CS in the G4-aware driver.

Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
index 2c31335ed..2cc3ba134 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
@@ -31,7 +31,9 @@ properties:
               - samsung,exynosautov920-spi
           - const: samsung,exynos850-spi
       - items:
-          - const: google,gs201-spi
+          - enum:
+              - google,gs201-spi
+              - google,zumapro-spi
           - const: google,gs101-spi
       - const: samsung,exynos7-spi
         deprecated: true
